DATA LICENCE NOTICE

This software downloads and processes data from third-party public archives.
Those datasets are NOT covered by the MIT licence above and remain subject to
their providers' terms of use:

  * The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA) data served via cBioPortal
    https://www.cbioportal.org/ - see https://www.cancer.gov/tcga
  * The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA) data served via UCSC Xena
    https://tcga.xenahubs.net/ - see https://gdc.cancer.gov/access-data/page-documentation/

No raw patient-level data is redistributed with this repository. Q-OMICS
caches downloaded matrices locally under `data/` at run time and ships only
derived aggregate results.
